    {
      "date": "1970-10-08",
      "kind": "planning decision",
      "description": "The City-owned lot was then a triangle of about 7,100 square feet fronting Palou Avenue and Industrial Street, in an M-1 zone. The City Planning Commission found a one-year lease of the City lot to Arden Farms Company for truck parking in conformity with the Master Plan, and recommended the City keep the property.",
